al attempts blocked by the player while they were on the floor." data-filter="1" data-name="">BLK%</th> <th aria-label="TOV%" data-stat="tov_pct" scope="col" class=" poptip hide_non_quals center" data-tip="&lt;b&gt;Turnover Percentage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;An estimate of turnovers committed per 100 plays." data-filter="1" data-name="">TOV%</th> <th aria-label="USG%" data-stat="usg_pct" scope="col" class=" poptip hide_non_quals center" data-tip="&lt;b&gt;Usage Percentage&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;An estimate of the percentage of team plays used by a player while they were on the floor." data-filter="1" data-name="">USG%</th> <th aria-label="OWS" data-stat="ows" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;b&gt;Offensive Win Shares&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;An estimate of the number of wins contributed by a player due to offense." data-filter="1" data-name="">OWS</th> <th aria-label="DWS" data-stat="dws" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;b&gt;Defensive Win Shares&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;An estimate of the number of wins contributed by a player due to defense." data-filter="1" data-name="">DWS</th> <th aria-label="WS" data-stat="ws" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;b&gt;Win Shares&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;An estimate of the number of wins contributed by a player." data-filter="1" data-name="">WS</th> <th aria-label="WS/48" data-stat="ws_per_48" scope="col" class=" poptip hide_non_quals center" data-tip="&lt;b&gt;Win Shares Per 48 Minutes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;An estimate of the number of wins contributed by a player per 48 minutes (league average is approximately .100)" data-filter="1" data-name="">WS/48</th> <th aria-label="OBPM" data-stat="obpm" scope="col" class=" poptip hide_non_quals center" data-tip="&lt;b&gt;Offensive Box Plus/Minus&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A box score estimate of the offensive points per 100 possessions a player contributed above a league-average player, translated to an average team." data-filter="1" data-name="">OBPM</th> <th aria-label="DBPM" 